    "name": "Cryptigma",
    "steam_appid": 3207870,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Cryptigma</i></strong> is a top-down innovative puzzle game where you can <i>move your own respawn point.</i> Most levels have a respawn point, which can be pushed around to maneuver your way around obstacles. With only a few mechanics, the puzzles get surprisingly complicated.\u00a0Push, die, respawn, and solve <u>over 100 levels</u>\u00a0in this great puzzle game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, you'll be introduced to new ways to die such as: poisoning, drowning, freezing, or electrocution. Each new way to die will mix things up in their own unique way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207870/extras/cebf2958491c424e684feadb43012e10.poster.avif?t=1744475332\" width=438 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207870/extras/cebf2958491c424e684feadb43012e10.webm?t=1744475332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a skeleton, who has been blown far away from its grave due to an intense windstorm, and it is your job to help bring him back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, you'll head through many different worlds, each with their own theming. Walk through a forest, hike through a mountain, run through a swamp, and find yourself immersed in puzzle solving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With\u00a0<strong><i><u>12</u></i></strong> worlds, each with <u><i><strong>10</strong></i></u> levels, so a total of <u><i><strong>120 levels</strong></i></u>, the fun will never end!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207870/extras/642be0df80d0708dbc8b553ec871f3da.poster.avif?t=1744475332\" width=720 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207870/extras/642be0df80d0708dbc8b553ec871f3da.webm?t=1744475332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level is meticulously crafted for a trick or lesson to be learned. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While you might get stumped, there are always many other levels to go to. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, sit back, relax, and enjoy these perplexing puzzles!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Cryptigma</i></strong> is a top-down innovative puzzle game where you can <i>move your own respawn point.</i> Most levels have a respawn point, which can be pushed around to maneuver your way around obstacles. With only a few mechanics, the puzzles get surprisingly complicated.\u00a0Push, die, respawn, and solve <u>over 100 levels</u>\u00a0in this great puzzle game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, you'll be introduced to new ways to die such as: poisoning, drowning, freezing, or electrocution. Each new way to die will mix things up in their own unique way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207870/extras/cebf2958491c424e684feadb43012e10.poster.avif?t=1744475332\" width=438 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207870/extras/cebf2958491c424e684feadb43012e10.webm?t=1744475332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a skeleton, who has been blown far away from its grave due to an intense windstorm, and it is your job to help bring him back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, you'll head through many different worlds, each with their own theming. Walk through a forest, hike through a mountain, run through a swamp, and find yourself immersed in puzzle solving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With\u00a0<strong><i><u>12</u></i></strong> worlds, each with <u><i><strong>10</strong></i></u> levels, so a total of <u><i><strong>120 levels</strong></i></u>, the fun will never end!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207870/extras/